GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/events/{event_id}/raw/{raw_id}
Retrieves raw threat event data for a specific event in Cloudforce One.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; event_id (path) — Event UUID.; raw_id (path) — Raw Event UUID.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/cloudforce-one/events/raw/{dataset_id}/{event_id}
Deprecated; use GET /events/datasets/{dataset_id}/events/{event_id}/raw. Available through 2026-11-28.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; event_id (path) — Event ID.; dataset_id (path) — Dataset ID.
